        "original_id": "dfc4d0ea-2b8f-5af8-9637-10761080fa05",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Concepts: Senior military colleges, Reserve Officers' Training Corps\n- Places: United States\n- Organizations: United States Armed Forces\n- Laws: 10 USC 2111a(f)\n\nFacts:\n- In the United States, a senior military college is one of six colleges that offer Reserve Officers' Training Corps programs under 10 USC 2111a(f).\n- In the United States, many schools other than senior military colleges also offer Reserve Officers' Training Corps programs under other sections of the law.\n- The Reserve Officers' Training Corps are college-based officer training programs that train commissioned officers for the United States Armed Forces.",
